      "comment": "AWE PEANUT (6) has mixed form recently, finishing seventh (24.93) in a Grade 5 at Traralgon latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Will find this more suitable and can atone. WANGARATTA GIRL (8) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (28.56) last time in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 at Bendigo. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Should be about the money. JACKALOPE (2) failed to come into contention last start after missing the jump at Ballarat, but prior to that won by 1.3 lengths at this track (22.91) beating Kenzie Kid in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 on October 17. Should play a prominent role. DREAM ON ALLAN (4) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
